15:03.520 --> 15:04.610
<b>What are those?</b>

15:04.690 --> 15:07.820
<b>Ew! Oh, God, scorpions! So gross!</b>

15:07.900 --> 15:08.900
<b>What the heck?</b>

15:08.990 --> 15:12.200
<b>Ugh, I hate tombs. I am so over this--</b>

15:13.410 --> 15:15.410
<b>Well, well, big boy.</b>

15:15.490 --> 15:18.000
<b><i>Scorpions. The source of vitality.</i></b>

15:18.080 --> 15:20.710
<b><i>Bind to us in flesh and in blood.</i></b>

15:20.790 --> 15:23.250
<b><i>Gather our rage, and let it spill.</i></b>

15:23.340 --> 15:28.090
<b><i>Bitches! Tonight you are the ones
who will be devoured!</i></b>

15:29.220 --> 15:32.090
<b>Now that I see you in your Ghost form,
you're as good as dead.</b>

15:32.180 --> 15:33.180
<b>Repent!</b>

15:36.060 --> 15:37.060
<b><i>It is futile!</i></b>

15:37.140 --> 15:40.060
<b>Fine. You wanna play? How about this!</b>

15:41.730 --> 15:42.940
<b><i>Futile.</i></b>

15:46.780 --> 15:48.780
<b>Ha. Done and dead.</b>

15:48.860 --> 15:51.030
<b>Well, that was a mess… but whatever.</b>

15:51.110 --> 15:53.660
<b>Let's just grab the Heaven Coins
and get out of here.</b>

15:53.740 --> 15:56.160
<b><i>Hold your shticks.</i></b>

15:59.120 --> 16:02.210
<b>Fuck! Why don't our weapons work?</b>

16:06.040 --> 16:07.460
<b><i>I am Penis!</i></b>

16:07.550 --> 16:09.420
<b>Jack it! Go, go!</b>

16:09.510 --> 16:11.130
<b>-Come here!
-Aah! It's gaining on us!</b>

16:11.220 --> 16:12.590
<b>Put your back into it!</b>

16:15.800 --> 16:17.760
<b>-Did we lose him?
-Think so.</b>

16:19.560 --> 16:21.270
<b>This prick's persistent!</b>

16:25.860 --> 16:28.070
<b>It's even bigger than before!</b>

16:28.150 --> 16:32.400
<b>Do you think maybe the ruins
are feeding it power through the curse?</b>

16:32.490 --> 16:35.070
<b>Maybe that's how it keeps
regenerating and getting bigger?</b>

16:35.160 --> 16:36.160
<b>Huh?</b>

16:36.870 --> 16:39.790
<b>Maybe that's why your heavenly weapons
had no effect on it.</b>

16:40.910 --> 16:41.910
<b>I see how it is.</b>

16:42.000 --> 16:45.670
<b>So if we can draw it out of the ruins…</b>

16:45.750 --> 16:47.920
<b>-Panty, look!
-I see it! Let's go!</b>

17:03.520 --> 17:04.520
<b>-Huh?
-Huh?</b>

17:04.600 --> 17:07.520
<b>Look how cute it is
now that we're out of the ruins.</b>

17:07.610 --> 17:09.570
<b>It went limp.</b>

17:09.650 --> 17:12.780
<b>Hey, little buddy, what happened?
You were so gung ho before.</b>

17:12.860 --> 17:15.320
<b>Sorry, little sausage. Repent!</b>

17:30.000 --> 17:31.170
<b>You saved me.</b>

17:31.250 --> 17:33.210
<b>Thank you, Panty.</b>

17:33.300 --> 17:34.880
<b>Geez, you are always such a handful.</b>

17:34.970 --> 17:36.680
<b>And all we get is this?</b>

17:36.760 --> 17:38.970
<b>All that effort
just for a teeny, tiny little coin.</b>

17:39.800 --> 17:42.270
<b>Well that was hardly worth
getting out of bed for.</b>

17:42.350 --> 17:45.850
<b>If we'd taken the treasure,
we could be buying sweets right now.</b>

17:45.940 --> 17:49.110
<b>Garter is so gonna get
what's coming for him when we get back.</b>

17:59.320 --> 18:01.120
<b>-<i>The Plush.</i>
-<i>The Plush.</i></b>

18:09.670 --> 18:14.550
<b>Fuck! I ask Garter to give Honekoneko
a wash and look what happens!</b>

18:14.630 --> 18:16.930
<b>I told him it has to be hand-washed!</b>

18:17.010 --> 18:21.010
<b>I'm sorry, Honekoneko.
I'll make you better, don't worry.</b>

18:21.100 --> 18:22.810
<b>Let's see… plushies…</b>

18:22.890 --> 18:24.970
<b>How do you fix a plushie?</b>

18:25.060 --> 18:26.680
<b>Confirming Honekoneko prior to repairs.</b>

18:26.770 --> 18:27.940
<b>Who's this tool?</b>

18:28.020 --> 18:31.560
<b>I'm Agent Tom Croose Jr.
from the PreCrime Division.</b>

18:31.650 --> 18:33.530
<b>I come from the future, in 2054.</b>

18:34.980 --> 18:35.990
<b>I'm a time traveler.</b>

18:36.070 --> 18:38.700
<b>Here. Have a signed photo as a keepsake.</b>

18:38.780 --> 18:39.950
<b>Yeah, no thanks.</b>

18:40.030 --> 18:42.990
<b>This is the future
as predicted by Precogs.</b>

18:44.910 --> 18:49.750
<b>Your decision to repair your Honekoneko
now will trigger a strange turn of events.</b>

18:49.830 --> 18:53.500
<b>The Honekoneko awaken
to a new order of intelligence,</b>

18:53.590 --> 18:57.260
<b>and they command an army of plushies
to subjugate all of humanity.</b>

18:57.340 --> 18:59.880
<b>Ooh! So I'm actually a genius!</b>

19:01.180 --> 19:02.430
<b>Hey! What are you doing?</b>

19:03.100 --> 19:04.310
<b>Are you resisting?</b>

19:04.390 --> 19:08.140
<b>I must eliminate that Honekoneko
to prevent further crimes in the future!</b>

19:08.230 --> 19:09.480
<b>You're insane!</b>

19:09.560 --> 19:12.480
<b>I am a time traveler!
Heed my warning from 2054!</b>

19:12.560 --> 19:14.400
<b>Can't you go bother someone
in a different year?</b>

19:14.480 --> 19:16.900
<b>That's it. I'm making a post about this.</b>

19:16.990 --> 19:18.820
<b>Prepare to get canceled, buddy.</b>

19:18.900 --> 19:20.280
<b>Huh?</b>

19:20.360 --> 19:22.700
<b>What the hell is it now?</b>

19:22.780 --> 19:26.790
<b>I am from the year 2029.
I am the Honekonator.</b>

19:26.870 --> 19:30.080
<b>Our Honekoneko leader
in the not-too-distant future</b>

19:30.160 --> 19:35.130
<b>is almost assassinated in this era
by a troublesome time traveler.</b>

19:35.210 --> 19:37.960
<b>I saw your post,
so I traveled back in time.</b>

19:38.050 --> 19:40.260
<b>Shit! Why did I have to make
that stupid post?</b>

19:41.800 --> 19:43.850
<b>2029 is not that far off!</b>

19:43.930 --> 19:48.600
<b>I am from 2054.
I am more of a time traveler than you!</b>

19:48.680 --> 19:49.680
<b><i>Hasta la vista</i>, baby.</b>

19:49.770 --> 19:52.400
<b>Quickly, quickly. Uh-oh!</b>

19:52.480 --> 19:55.520
<b>-Hurry up and close, doors!
-Come back, troublesome time traveler!</b>

19:55.610 --> 19:59.400
<b>You keep saying you're from the future.
What's so bad about the year 2054?</b>

19:59.490 --> 20:03.700
<b>The world is abuzz with news
of the newly-born panda twins.</b>

20:03.780 --> 20:05.490
<b>Panda twins? Sounds super wholesome.</b>

20:07.450 --> 20:09.370
<b>The year 2054 may be peaceful,</b>

20:09.450 --> 20:14.130
<b>but Precogs says Honekoneko makes it hell
on Earth for humanity in the year 3,000.</b>

20:14.210 --> 20:16.380
<b>Oh, how it makes me
toss and turn at night!</b>

20:16.460 --> 20:18.420
<b>That's why I have to kill Honekoneko!</b>

20:18.500 --> 20:20.920
<b>Die! Troublesome time traveler.</b>

20:21.010 --> 20:23.380
<b>All I wanted
was to fix my poor Honekoneko!</b>

20:33.810 --> 20:36.150
<b>Die! Troublesome time travel--</b>

20:36.230 --> 20:37.730
<b>Thanks for wait--</b>

20:39.780 --> 20:42.150
<b>I'll never come back.</b>

20:43.200 --> 20:49.200
<b>So basically some shit's gonna go down
if I try and fix Honekoneko right now.</b>

20:50.750 --> 20:54.580
<b>What if we got the person who
made this stuffed fella to fix it up?</b>

20:54.670 --> 20:56.000
<b>We can do that?</b>

20:56.080 --> 20:57.840
<b>You bet we can!</b>

20:58.630 --> 21:00.920
<b>I'm Gunsmith Bitch!</b>

21:01.260 --> 21:05.010
<b>We'll take it to the Pants Dimension.</b>

21:05.590 --> 21:09.140
<b>Bada-bing, bada-boom. We're here!
This is where Honekoneko was made.</b>

21:09.220 --> 21:10.220
<b>Ah, but just FYI.</b>

21:10.310 --> 21:13.940
<b>Time travel's dangerous,
so be careful, okay?</b>

21:14.020 --> 21:17.810
<b>Don't worry. I won't step on anything
or be a troublesome time traveler.</b>

21:17.900 --> 21:21.110
<b>I wonder who made
Honekoneko in the first place--</b>

21:21.190 --> 21:24.360
<b>Huh? Garter made Honekoneko?</b>

21:24.450 --> 21:27.740
<b>Hello, young ladies. How can
Cemetery Hills Church help you today?</b>

21:28.530 --> 21:31.120
<b>Oh my, it seems that poor plushie's
innards have spilled out.</b>

21:31.200 --> 21:32.200
<b>Can you fix my plushie?</b>

21:32.290 --> 21:34.370
<b>That's easy enough.</b>

21:34.460 --> 21:37.580
<b>As it happens, I'm just in the middle
of making a plushie myself.</b>

21:37.670 --> 21:39.880
<b>But I've been hemming and hawing
over what to make.</b>

21:39.960 --> 21:41.340
<b>Why are you making a plushie?</b>

21:41.420 --> 21:43.720
<b>I have two little girls staying with me,</b>

21:43.800 --> 21:46.430
<b>and the little sister
has been feeling homesick.</b>

21:46.510 --> 21:48.800
<b>I thought I'd gift her a little friend
to help cheer her up.</b>

21:49.390 --> 21:51.720
<b>She's never shown much interest
for the cutesy toys</b>

21:51.810 --> 21:53.560
<b>they sell at the department stores,</b>

21:53.640 --> 21:54.680
<b>so I made this one myself.</b>

21:54.770 --> 21:55.770
<b>What's this one's name?</b>

21:55.850 --> 21:57.600
<b>Honekoneko.</b>

21:57.690 --> 21:59.900
<b>And is Honekoneko very important to you?</b>

21:59.980 --> 22:03.480
<b>We're always together. My best friend.</b>

22:03.570 --> 22:04.570
<b>I see.</b>

22:04.650 --> 22:06.320
<b>There you go. All better.</b>

22:06.400 --> 22:08.030
<b>Honekoneko!</b>

22:08.740 --> 22:13.040
<b>I think my own little girl
might like something like Honekoneko too.</b>

22:13.660 --> 22:15.460
<b>Mind if I copy the design?</b>

22:15.540 --> 22:17.790
<b>Sure, go ahead.</b>

22:17.870 --> 22:21.000
<b>But make sure you only
ever hand-wash him, okay?</b>

22:21.090 --> 22:22.500
<b>Handwash? Noted.</b>

22:25.510 --> 22:26.970
<b>Thank you, Garter.</b>

22:31.760 --> 22:36.640
<b>Kill the one who made it,
and Honekoneko will never be born.</b>

22:36.730 --> 22:40.270
<b>I must terminate you
to prevent future crimes!</b>

22:45.230 --> 22:46.860
<b>Who the hell…</b>

22:47.950 --> 22:50.490
<b>All me need is kill.</b>

22:51.160 --> 22:53.830
<b>Now the future is safe.</b>

23:00.500 --> 23:02.210
<b>Well, I'm glad that's over.</b>

23:02.290 --> 23:04.960
<b>I'm pooped. Let's have an early bed time.
What do you say, Honekoneko--</b>

23:05.880 --> 23:08.470
<b>Honeko-- Wait, where are your bones?
Are you just Konekoneko?</b>

23:08.550 --> 23:10.180
<b>Welcome back, Stocking.</b>

23:13.510 --> 23:14.510
<b>Sup.</b>

23:14.600 --> 23:16.600
<b>Oops.</b>

24:52.450 --> 24:54.450
<b>Subtitle: Daisy Savage & Rychelle Brittain</b>
